query.description:
Query parameters. Depends on the source:
- weather: { location: "city name" }
- exchange_rate: { from: "USD", to: "EUR" }
- ip_geolocation: { ip: "8.8.8.8" } (empty for own IP)
- random_fact: {} (no params needed)
- country_info: { name: "Japan" }
- github_user: { username: "torvalds" }
- npm_package: { name: "express" }
- dns_lookup: { domain: "google.com" }
